# Summer at a glance

Thank you to every child and teen who read with us this summer. Here is how the season went.

kpi Registered | 1,248 | children and teens | neutral
kpi Finished | 683 | 54.7% of registered | good
kpi Books logged | 8,325 | 6.7 per registered reader | good
kpi Closing party | 310 | people on 2026-09-12 | neutral

# Books logged by month

July was the busiest month, with 3,115 books logged. Readers kept going in August, and the three months added up to 8,325 books.

chart bar months y=books focus="Jul" labels title="Books logged per month"

# Readers by age group

The 8 to 12 group was the largest, with 561 of our 1,248 registered readers.

chart hbar ages y=readers labels title="Registered readers by age group"
